248 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 122 0 R/E(print orientation  they are also strong enough to lift a lobster pot without assistance from the primary manipulator \(although the primary manipulator is also capable to lifting the lobster pot on its own as well\).)/Pg 12 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

249 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 122 0 R/E(Cameras and sensors were the last elements to be added on, with a front, rear, and underside-facing camera available to the pilots for ease of maneuverability, as well as for use in the photogrammetry and crab identification tasks. Additionally, an IMU was added for additional stability while operating the ROV in currents of variable intensity.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

