398 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 133 0 R/E(Extensive focus was placed on optimizing the manipulator to securely grasp mission props, primarily by reducing the play in the gripper links. Slop in the link was corrected by tightening tolerances, loosening in the lead screw by adding a heat set insert mount, and introducing a guide bushing, and misalignment in the wrist by adding a second dry running bearing.)/Pg 23 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

399 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 133 0 R/E(Additionally, 9 TPU grip designs were developed over the season to increase flexibility. A ray-fin design was adopted to conform around curved shapes, and bumps were added to reduce the lubrication effects of the water surrounding the surface of each prop.)/Pg 23 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

