448 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 138 0 R/E(At the time of our writing, over 50% of the 500+ designed parts in this year\220s S.M.S CAD library are in-house 3D prints. These 265 unique 3D printed parts embody our team\220s commitment to personally designing and fabricating as many of our components as possible. ROSIE also features a variety of outsourced materials, each selected for their essential role in completing this year\220s mission requirements. The tables below detail the selection procedures for key built versus bought parts. Note that because we are a first-year team, we did not re-use any components from a previous ROV.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

