461 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 139 0 R/E(At the conclusion of the week, the nickel-plated T-slot nuts displayed visible discoloration, and white aluminum oxide was observed in the highest concentrations around the overtightened bolts. In response, SMS exclusively adopted stainless T-nuts and established a standard bolt size and material thickness for all T-slot connections to limit corrosion from overtorqued bolts.)/Pg 29 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

462 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 139 0 R/E(Figure 37: Corrosion testing, salt v. freshwater test)/Pg 29 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

463 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 139 0 R/E(The float peristaltic pump was feasibility tested in a sugar-ice water solution to simulate the conditions in the ice tank to verify that its flow rate remained acceptable even under poor conditions.)/Pg 29 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

464 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 139 0 R/E(To evaluate the performance of our thruster shrouds, load cell thrust testing was performed. An 18% reduction in thrust was observed in initial iterations of t)/Pg 29 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

