534 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 140 0 R/E(As the season progressed, our budget shifted based on actual funding and design needs. Early on, we had to be conservative with purchases while waiting for sponsorships, grants, MESA volunteering funds, university support, and fundraising revenue to come in. Once funding became more certain, we were able to move forward with larger purchases for the ROV, float, travel, and competition logistics. This is largely in part due to the financial team\220s persistence utilizing the SMS proprietary CRM tool for sponsorship acquisition, as well as leveraging connections with local business owners throughout the state. )/Pg 30 0 R/K[62]>>
endobj

535 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 140 0 R/E(Overall, SMS is projected to remain under its 2026 budget while still completing the ROV, float, and competition travel plan. More importantly, this first season gave the team real financial data that can be used to create stronger, more accurate budgets in future years.)/Pg 30 0 R/K[63]>>
endobj

